    "name": "Royal Lodge @ Pagoda Street",
    "detail": "I enjoyed 2 nights stay here . Location is just right next to Chinatown MRT exit A . Very convenient. Overall hostel is clean. Bed is clean & comfort . Staff are friendly . They can allow you to allocate your luggage before check in & after check out too. No deposit is required. There is a small curtain in our bed so there is a little bit of privacy. Just that it’s a bit annoying when your neighbours was chitchatting while you sleeping . Please don’t be that kind of person when you know you are sharing room with others . Bathroom very small . It Could be a little bit bigger . If you are oversize I don’t think you can fit in the bathroom. Overall it’s a good experience staying there . Will definitely visit again when I visit Singapore !😊",
